{"ticker":"AFL","updated":"2026-11-06T22:38:07Z","profile":{"longName":"Aflac Incorporated","shortName":"AFLAC Incorporated","sector":"Financial Services","industry":"Insurance - Life","country":"United States","website":"https://www.aflac.com","fullTimeEmployees":12716,"marketCap":61490462720,"trailingPE":18.110949,"forwardPE":16.219326,"priceToSalesTrailing12Months":3.7042446,"pegRatio":1.18,"targetMeanPrice":117.33333,"targetHighPrice":138.0,"targetLowPrice":101.0,"numberOfAnalystOpinions":15,"recommendationKey":"none","revenueGrowth":-0.31,"earningsGrowth":-0.802,"grossMargins":0.46613997,"operatingMargins":0.17426,"profitMargins":0.21240999,"totalRevenue":16600000512,"beta":null,"fiftyTwoWeekHigh":131.19,"fiftyTwoWeekLow":105.76,"currency":"USD","exchange":"NYQ","quoteType":"EQUITY","dividendYield":1.93},"summary":"Aflac Incorporated, through its subsidiaries, provides supplemental health and life insurance products. It operates in two segments, Aflac Japan and Aflac U.S. The Aflac Japan segment offers cancer, medical, nursing care, whole life, and GIFT insurance products, as well as WAYS and child endowment, and Tsumitasu insurance products in Japan. Its Aflac U.S. segment provides accident, disability, cancer, critical illness, hospital indemnity, dental, vision, and life insurance products in the United States. The company also provides hearing, final expense, pet, Medicare supplement, supplemental dental and vision, short-term disability, and absence management insurance products, as well as cafeteria plans. It sells its products to individuals, families, and business owners through individual, independent corporate, and affiliated corporate agencies; banks; independent associates/career agents; and brokers. Aflac Incorporated was founded in 1955 and is headquartered in Columbus, Georgia.","summary_zh":"Aflac Incorporated 透過其子公司提供補充健康和人壽保險產品。該公司分為兩個部門：Aflac Japan 和 Aflac U.S. Aflac Japan 部門在日本提供癌症、醫療、護理、終身壽險和 GIFT 保險產品，以及 WAYS 和兒童養老保險以及 Tsumitasu 保險產品。其 Aflac 美國部門在美國提供事故、殘疾、癌症、重大疾病、醫院賠償、牙科、視力和人壽保險產品。該公司還提供聽力、最終費用、寵物、醫療保險補助、補充牙科和視力、短期殘疾和缺勤管理保險產品以及自助餐廳計劃。它透過個人、獨立公司和附屬公司機構向個人、家庭和企業主銷售其產品；銀行；獨立合夥人/職業經紀人；和經紀人。 Aflac Incorporated 成立於 1955 年，總部位於喬治亞州哥倫布。","sector_zh":"金融服務","industry_zh":"保險 - 壽險","candles":[{"t":"2025-09-08","o":106.31,"h":106.55,"l":104.66,"c":106.34,"v":2971300},{"t":"2025-09-09","o":106.22,"h":106.96,"l":105.48,"c":106.28,"v":1833300},{"t":"2025-09-10","o":105.86,"h":107.29,"l":105.66,"c":107.23,"v":2093200},{"t":"2025-09-11","o":107.18,"h":108.75,"l":106.93,"c":108.69,"v":1927200},{"t":"2025-09-12","o":108.51,"h":109.51,"l":108.12,"c":109.13,"v":1800000},{"t":"2025-09-15","o":109.04,"h":109.29,"l":108.2,"c":108.41,"v":1836500},{"t":"2025-09-16","o":108.01,"h":108.11,"l":106.96,"c":107.63,"v":2874500},{"t":"2025-09-17","o":107.99,"h":109.99,"l":107.1,"c":109.23,"v":2354400},{"t":"2025-09-18","o":108.69,"h":109.34,"l":107.98,"c":108.0,"v":3167900},{"t":"2025-09-19","o":108.37,"h":108.57,"l":107.8,"c":108.04,"v":6940700},{"t":"2025-09-22","o":107.77,"h":108.17,"l":107.23,"c":107.4,"v":2673800},{"t":"2025-09-23","o":107.35,"h":109.42,"l":106.85,"c":108.23,"v":2539900},{"t":"2025-09-24","o":108.19,"h":109.36,"l":107.91,"c":109.31,"v":2134300},{"t":"2025-09-25","o":109.57,"h":110.11,"l":108.62,"c":109.48,"v":1913100},{"t":"2025-09-26","o":110.3,"h":111.44,"l":109.94,"c":111.36,"v":1878500},{"t":"2025-09-29","o":111.45,"h":111.66,"l":110.7,"c":111.35,"v":2286200},{"t":"2025-09-30","o":111.37,"h":111.85,"l":110.6,"c":111.7,"v":2523100},{"t":"2025-10-01","o":111.0,"h":111.34,"l":110.17,"c":110.75,"v":1708900},{"t":"2025-10-02","o":110.3,"h":111.19,"l":109.66,"c":110.6,"v":1704200},{"t":"2025-10-03","o":110.57,"h":112.42,"l":110.06,"c":112.32,"v":1621300},{"t":"2025-10-06","o":112.39,"h":113.39,"l":111.37,"c":113.07,"v":1607000},{"t":"2025-10-07","o":113.33,"h":113.9,"l":112.55,"c":112.93,"v":1719400},{"t":"2025-10-08","o":113.0,"h":113.29,"l":111.74,"c":111.9,"v":1756700},{"t":"2025-10-09","o":112.4,"h":113.36,"